# Login Page Project

# About

A simple login page created using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Users can enter an email and password to access a portfolio webpage.


## Technologies Used

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript

## Features
* Show/Hide password
* Login success message
* Automatic redirection to 'sans.html'

## How to Run

1. Open 'login.html' in your browser using Live Server.
2. Enter an email and password.
3. Click **Login** to open the portfolio page.

## Note

This is a front-end demonstration. It accepts any non-empty email and password and does not provide real authentication.
